1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:02,368
The problem my clients come with,

2
00:00:02,388 --> 00:00:04,128
is just the tip of the iceberg.

3
00:00:04,148 --> 00:00:06,208
It is basically the symptoms.

4
00:00:06,228 --> 00:00:08,448
For us to do real work,

5
00:00:08,468 --> 00:00:10,768
for real change to happen,

6
00:00:10,788 --> 00:00:12,608
for a healthy life,

7
00:00:12,628 --> 00:00:14,848
a life with love, a life with joy

8
00:00:14,868 --> 00:00:16,448
and healthy relationships,

9
00:00:16,468 --> 00:00:17,328
I need to understand

10
00:00:17,348 --> 00:00:19,328
my client's whole story.

11
00:00:19,348 --> 00:00:21,728
From pregnancy, if possible,

12
00:00:21,748 --> 00:00:23,648
early childhood, adolescence,

13
00:00:23,668 --> 00:00:25,248
first relationships,

14
00:00:25,268 --> 00:00:26,848
with friends, with love,

15
00:00:26,868 --> 00:00:29,216
what your parents' marriage was like.

16
00:00:29,236 --> 00:00:30,976
How you feel about money,

17
00:00:30,996 --> 00:00:33,003
about your work, about people,

18
00:00:33,023 --> 00:00:35,216
how healthy your relationship is

19
00:00:35,236 --> 00:00:36,730
with yourself.
